{"seq":3,"slug":"pnpm-and-monorepos","title":"pnpm 与 Monorepo","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/pnpm-and-monorepos","wordCount":1020,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"pnpm-与-monorepo\">pnpm 与 Monorepo</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>pnpm 解决的问题和 Monorepo 的组织方式，共同构成了多包仓库的工程基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内容寻址存储 + 硬链接</strong>：同一个包在所有项目中只存一份真实文件，其余是硬链接——磁盘占用从 &quot;N 份拷贝&quot; 降为 &quot;1 份存储 + N 个链接&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>严格的 node_modules 结构</strong>：根目录只包含 package.json 中声明的直接依赖的符号链接，实际文件放在 <code>.pnpm/</code> 虚拟存储中。幽灵依赖因此完全不可能出现。</li>\n<li><strong>Monorepo</strong>：把多个相关包放进同一个 Git 仓库，共享工具链、统一版本管理。</li>\n<li><strong>pnpm Workspace</strong>：用 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 声明包目录，<code>workspace:</code> 协议让包之间互相引用本地版本。</li>\n<li><strong>共享配置与 Turbo 加速</strong>：TypeScript 配置可继承，Turborepo 用任务图与缓存加速多包构建。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pnpm-的核心优势\">pnpm 的核心优势</h2><p>pnpm（Performant npm）是一个革命性的包管理器，它通过内容寻址存储和硬链接机制，从根本上解决了 npm 和 yarn 的两大痛点：磁盘空间浪费和幽灵依赖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;npm 传统方式&quot;&#10;        P1[&quot;项目 A&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18&quot;] --&gt; NM1[&quot;node_modules/&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18&lt;br/&gt;+30 个子依赖&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;项目 B&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18&quot;] --&gt; NM2[&quot;node_modules/&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18&lt;br/&gt;+30 个子依赖&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;pnpm 方式&quot;&#10;        PA[项目 A] --&gt; HLA[硬链接]&#10;        PB[项目 B] --&gt; HLB[硬链接]&#10;        HLA --&gt; STORE[&quot;全局存储&lt;br/&gt;~/.local/share/pnpm/store&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18 仅一份&quot;]&#10;        HLB --&gt; STORE&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"npm 传统方式\"\n        P1[\"项目 A&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18\"] --&gt; NM1[\"node_modules/&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18&lt;br/&gt;+30 个子依赖\"]\n        P2[\"项目 B&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18\"] --&gt; NM2[\"node_modules/&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18&lt;br/&gt;+30 个子依赖\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"pnpm 方式\"\n        PA[项目 A] --&gt; HLA[硬链接]\n        PB[项目 B] --&gt; HLB[硬链接]\n        HLA --&gt; STORE[\"全局存储&lt;br/&gt;~/.local/share/pnpm/store&lt;br/&gt;express@4.18 仅一份\"]\n        HLB --&gt; STORE\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>npm/yarn</th>\n<th>pnpm</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储方式</td>\n<td>每个项目完整拷贝</td>\n<td>全局内容寻址存储 + 硬链接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 个项目同依赖</td>\n<td>10 份完整拷贝</td>\n<td>1 份存储 + 10 个硬链接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵依赖</td>\n<td>可能访问未声明的包</td>\n<td>严格隔离，不可访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装速度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>最快（已缓存时接近零）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pnpm-的-node_modules-结构\">pnpm 的 node_modules 结构</h2><p>pnpm 使用独特的<strong>符号链接 + 硬链接</strong>结构来组织 node_modules：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;项目 node_modules/&quot;&#10;        DIRECT[&quot;.pnpm/&quot;]&#10;        EXPRESS[&quot;express → .pnpm/express@4.18/node_modules/express&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;.pnpm/ (虚拟存储)&quot;&#10;        EX_DIR[&quot;.pnpm/express@4.18/node_modules/&quot;]&#10;        EX_REAL[&quot;express/ → 硬链接到全局存储&quot;]&#10;        EX_DEPS[&quot;accepts/&quot;]&#10;        EX_DEPS2[&quot;body-parser/&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;全局存储 (~/.local/share/pnpm/store/)&quot;&#10;        STORE_EX[&quot;express@4.18 内容&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    EXPRESS --&gt;|符号链接| EX_REAL&#10;    EX_REAL --&gt;|硬链接| STORE_EX\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"项目 node_modules/\"\n        DIRECT[\".pnpm/\"]\n        EXPRESS[\"express → .pnpm/express@4.18/node_modules/express\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \".pnpm/ (虚拟存储)\"\n        EX_DIR[\".pnpm/express@4.18/node_modules/\"]\n        EX_REAL[\"express/ → 硬链接到全局存储\"]\n        EX_DEPS[\"accepts/\"]\n        EX_DEPS2[\"body-parser/\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"全局存储 (~/.local/share/pnpm/store/)\"\n        STORE_EX[\"express@4.18 内容\"]\n    end\n    EXPRESS --&gt;|符号链接| EX_REAL\n    EX_REAL --&gt;|硬链接| STORE_EX</pre><p>关键设计：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>node_modules 根目录只包含 package.json 中声明的<strong>直接依赖</strong>的符号链接</li>\n<li>所有包的实际文件存储在 <code>.pnpm/</code> 目录中</li>\n<li><code>.pnpm/</code> 中的文件通过硬链接指向全局内容寻址存储</li>\n<li>子依赖通过符号链接互相引用</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这意味着<strong>幽灵依赖完全不可能</strong>——只有 package.json 中声明的包才会出现在 node_modules 的根层级。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pnpm-基本使用\">pnpm 基本使用</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install -g pnpm&#10;&#10;pnpm install&#10;pnpm add express&#10;pnpm add -D typescript&#10;pnpm remove lodash&#10;&#10;pnpm run dev&#10;pnpm test&#10;pnpm dlx tsx script.ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> express</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typescript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lodash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dlx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script.ts</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用配置-npmrc\">常用配置（.npmrc）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"shamefully-hoist=false&#10;strict-peer-dependencies=true&#10;auto-install-peers=true&#10;node-linker=hoisted\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>shamefully-hoist=false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strict-peer-dependencies=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>auto-install-peers=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>node-linker=hoisted</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>shamefully-hoist=true</code> 会将所有依赖提升到根 node_modules，模拟 npm 的行为——这主要用于兼容不支持 pnpm 严格结构的工具，但会失去幽灵依赖防护。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-基础\">Monorepo 基础</h2><p>Monorepo（单仓多包）是将多个相关项目放在同一个 Git 仓库中管理的工程实践。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Monorepo&#10;        ROOT[根目录&lt;br/&gt;package.json&lt;br/&gt;pnpm-workspace.yaml]&#10;        PKG_A[packages/core&lt;br/&gt;核心库]&#10;        PKG_B[packages/cli&lt;br/&gt;CLI 工具]&#10;        PKG_C[packages/ui&lt;br/&gt;UI 组件库]&#10;        APP[apps/web&lt;br/&gt;Web 应用]&#10;        ROOT --&gt; PKG_A&#10;        ROOT --&gt; PKG_B&#10;        ROOT --&gt; PKG_C&#10;        ROOT --&gt; APP&#10;        APP --&gt; PKG_A&#10;        APP --&gt; PKG_C&#10;        PKG_B --&gt; PKG_A&#10;        PKG_C --&gt; PKG_A&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Monorepo\n        ROOT[根目录&lt;br/&gt;package.json&lt;br/&gt;pnpm-workspace.yaml]\n        PKG_A[packages/core&lt;br/&gt;核心库]\n        PKG_B[packages/cli&lt;br/&gt;CLI 工具]\n        PKG_C[packages/ui&lt;br/&gt;UI 组件库]\n        APP[apps/web&lt;br/&gt;Web 应用]\n        ROOT --&gt; PKG_A\n        ROOT --&gt; PKG_B\n        ROOT --&gt; PKG_C\n        ROOT --&gt; APP\n        APP --&gt; PKG_A\n        APP --&gt; PKG_C\n        PKG_B --&gt; PKG_A\n        PKG_C --&gt; PKG_A\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"优势与挑战\">优势与挑战</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码共享</td>\n<td>直接引用内部包，无需发布</td>\n<td>需要管理包间依赖关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子变更</td>\n<td>跨包修改在同一个 commit 中</td>\n<td>CI/CD 需要识别变更范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具统一</td>\n<td>统一的 lint、test、build 配置</td>\n<td>仓库体积可能很大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本管理</td>\n<td>协调一致的版本发布</td>\n<td>版本策略需要精心设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pnpm-workspace\">pnpm Workspace</h2><p>pnpm 通过 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 定义 workspace：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"packages:&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;tools/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tools/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"项目结构示例\">项目结构示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"monorepo/&#10;├── pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;├── package.json&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── core/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── src/&#10;│   ├── utils/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── src/&#10;│   └── types/&#10;│       ├── package.json&#10;│       └── src/&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   ├── web/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── src/&#10;│   └── api/&#10;│       ├── package.json&#10;│       └── src/&#10;└── tsconfig.base.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>monorepo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── core/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── utils/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── types/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── web/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── tsconfig.base.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"workspace-协议\">workspace 协议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/core&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:^1.0.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/core\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:^1.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>workspace:</code> 协议告诉 pnpm 从本地 workspace 解析包，而非从 Registry 下载。发布时，pnpm 会自动将 <code>workspace:*</code> 替换为实际版本号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议写法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>发布时替换为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>workspace:*</td>\n<td>匹配当前版本</td>\n<td>1.2.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace:^</td>\n<td>兼容当前版本</td>\n<td>^1.2.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace:~</td>\n<td>近似当前版本</td>\n<td>~1.2.3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"workspace-命令\">Workspace 命令</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pnpm --filter @myorg/web dev&#10;&#10;pnpm --filter @myorg/core build&#10;&#10;pnpm --filter &quot;./packages/**&quot; test&#10;&#10;pnpm --filter @myorg/web... build&#10;&#10;pnpm -r run build&#10;&#10;pnpm -r --parallel run lint\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myorg/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myorg/core</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"./packages/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"colo