 &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;^5.3.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r run test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r --parallel run lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"clean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r exec rm -rf dist node_modules\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"devDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typescript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^5.3.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将所有包共用的 devDependencies 安装在根目录，避免重复声明。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-加速构建\">Turborepo 加速构建</h2><p>pnpm workspace 经常与 Turborepo 搭配使用，实现智能缓存和并行构建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CORE_BUILD[core:build] --&gt; UTILS_BUILD[utils:build]&#10;    CORE_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD[web:build]&#10;    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD&#10;    WEB_BUILD --&gt; WEB_TEST[web:test]\">flowchart LR\n    CORE_BUILD[core:build] --&gt; UTILS_BUILD[utils:build]\n    CORE_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD[web:build]\n    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD\n    WEB_BUILD --&gt; WEB_TEST[web:test]</pre><p>Turborepo 会分析任务依赖图，自动并行执行不相互依赖的任务，并缓存已完成的任务输出。当文件没有变化时，后续构建几乎是即时完成。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>pnpm 通过内容寻址存储和硬链接实现包的全局去重，大幅节省磁盘空间。</li>\n<li>pnpm 的严格 node_modules 结构彻底杜绝了幽灵依赖问题。</li>\n<li>pnpm-workspace.yaml 定义 workspace 包范围，workspace: 协议管理包间依赖。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>--filter</code> 精确控制命令执行范围，<code>-r</code> 在所有包中执行。</li>\n<li>共享配置（TypeScript、ESLint 等）放在根目录，通过继承机制复用。</li>\n<li>Turborepo 与 pnpm workspace 搭配使用，实现智能缓存和并行构建。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"pnpm 与 Monorepo","id":"pnpm-与-monorepo"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm 的核心优势","id":"pnpm-的核心优势"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm 的 node_modules 结构","id":"pnpm-的-node_modules-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm 基本使用","id":"pnpm-基本使用"},{"level":3,"text":"常用配置（.npmrc）","id":"常用配置-npmrc"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 基础","id":"monorepo-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"优势与挑战","id":"优势与挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm Workspace","id":"pnpm-workspace"},{"level":3,"text":"项目结构示例","id":"项目结构示例"},{"level":3,"text":"workspace 协议","id":"workspace-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"Workspace 命令","id":"workspace-命令"},{"level":3,"text":"过滤器语法","id":"过滤器语法"},{"level":2,"text":"共享配置","id":"共享配置"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 配置继承","id":"typescript-配置继承"},{"level":3,"text":"根 package.json","id":"根-package-json"},{"level":2,"text":"Turborepo 加速构建","id":"turborepo-加速构建"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"深入 package.json","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/package-json-in-depth"},"next":{"title":"版本管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/version-management-and-publishing"}}